{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07466","headline":"避地江东留别淮南使院诸公 · 刘长卿","name":"避地江东留别淮南使院诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安路绝鸟飞通，万里孤云西复东。\n旧业已应成茂草，余生只是任飘蓬。\n何辞向物开秦镜，却使他人得楚弓。\n此去行持一竿竹，等闲将狎钓渔翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07466.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07466","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}